# No gradients

Do not use gradients in this portfolio.

Forbidden:

- Tailwind `bg-gradient-*`, `from-*`, `via-*`, `to-*` used as a gradient fill
- `bg-clip-text` with a gradient
- CSS `linear-gradient`, `radial-gradient`, `conic-gradient`, `repeating-linear-gradient`
- SVG `<linearGradient>` and `<radialGradient>`
- Gradient mask/border tricks (`mask-image` with a gradient, `conic-gradient` borders)

Use a single solid color from existing tokens or Tailwind palette instead.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
className="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-purple-600"

// ✅ GOOD
className="bg-blue-600"
```

```css
/* ❌ BAD */
background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dff1ff, #fde3f2);

/* ✅ GOOD */
background: var(--ds-background-100);
```

Grid lines may use an SVG `<pattern>` with a solid stroke. Do not fake a grid with CSS gradients.
